message: >-
  If you use or reference this research, please cite the UCPSF
  repository using the metadata provided in this file.

type: software

title: >-
  Universal Control Planes and Scoring Tree/Forest/Folding
  for Structural Intelligence (UCPSF)

abstract: >-
  This research repository proposes a unified framework for
  Generalized Scoring Intelligence, Scoring Trees and Forests,
  Value-Based Folding, Branching-Based Folding, ANN Scoring
  Nodes, Unaligned AND Folding, recursive Common Concept Core
  (CCC) distillation, Perspective-Aware Meta-Scoring, and
  Dual-Hybrid Localization and Per-Node Intelligence.

  The framework introduces a proposed Universal Control Plane
  for coordinating heterogeneous intelligence components,
  evaluation structures, evidence, governance, and Structural
  Recursive Self-Improvement (RSI).

  The initial release is a conceptual research and architecture
  contribution. Its proposed mechanisms and hypotheses require
  further formalization and independent empirical validation.

